### 6. PDF Report Generation Improvements
Added: September 17, 2025 23:30 PST

Modified PDF quality report generation to use connection pool and proper connection management:

Previous implementation:
```python
def get_completeness_data(self, file_names: List[str]):
    try:
        cursor = self.db_connection.cursor(dictionary=True)
        # ...database operations with single connection
        cursor.close()
```

New implementation:
```python
def get_completeness_data(self, file_names: List[str]):
    try:
        with self.db_manager.get_connection(autocommit=True) as connection:
            cursor = connection.cursor(dictionary=True)
            # ...database operations with pooled connection
            cursor.close()
```

Changes made:
1. Now uses connection manager's get_connection() context manager
2. Each database operation gets fresh connection from pool
3. Set autocommit=True for read operations
4. Added proper connection cleanup through context manager

Testing Notes:
1. PDF generation more stable with new connection handling
2. No more connection timeouts during long queries
3. Proper cleanup of database resources
4. Verified single consolidated PDF generation

## Dashboard Updates & User Interface Enhancements
Added: September 17, 2025 23:45 PST

### 1. Enhanced Dual-Dashboard Metrics System

Modified dashboard metrics update system to properly handle both Data Analyser and Data Transformation sections. 

#### Changes to updateDashboardMetrics Function:
```javascript
// Previous implementation:
function updateDashboardMetrics() {
    fetch('/api/metrics')
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(data => {
            if (data.success && data.metrics) {
                const totalElement = document.getElementById('total-objects-processed');
                if (totalElement) {
                    totalElement.textContent = data.total.toLocaleString();
                }
            }
        });
}

// New implementation:
function updateDashboardMetrics(source) {
    fetch('/api/metrics')
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(data => {
            if (data.success && data.metrics) {
                const count = data.metrics.total_records_processed || 0;
                
                // Update based on upload source
                if (source === 'analyser' || !source) {
                    const analyserTotal = document.getElementById('total-objects-processed');
                    if (analyserTotal) {
                        analyserTotal.textContent = count.toLocaleString();
                    }
                }
                if (source === 'transformer' || !source) {
                    // Update transformer dashboard
                    const cards = document.querySelectorAll('#transformation-dashboard .card');
                    for (const card of cards) {
                        const title = card.querySelector('.card-title');
                        if (title && title.textContent === 'Records Processed') {
                            const valueElement = card.querySelector('.card-value');
                            if (valueElement) {
                                valueElement.textContent = count.toLocaleString();
                                break;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        });
}
```

#### File Upload Integration:
```javascript
// Added source detection in handleFiles
function handleFiles(files) {
    const uploadQueue = document.getElementById('upload-queue');
    
    // Determine which section we're in
    const analyserUpload = !document.querySelector('#transformation-dashboard').classList.contains('hidden');
    const source = analyserUpload ? 'analyser' : 'transformer';
    
    Array.from(files).forEach(file => {
        const queueItem = createQueueItem(file);
        uploadQueue.appendChild(queueItem);
        uploadFile(file, queueItem, source);
    });
}
```

#### Navigation Updates:
```javascript
// Enhanced section change handler
if (sectionId === 'dashboard') {
    updateDashboardMetrics('analyser');
} else if (sectionId === 'transformation-dashboard') {
    updateDashboardMetrics('transformer');
}
```

